english translation text:
Peace be upon you morning and evening, O visitor of Hussain;
the sun and moon themselves are your visitors.
Those who possess knowledge declare:
you were a sinner, but became a visitor of Hussain.
Your station has risen above the heavens;
Zamzam itself calls out: you have become pure.

God has opened the gate of virtue for you;
even the holy angels worship for your sake.
Kawthar is for you, and Paradise is for you;
on the day of Arafah, this honour is yours.
The One you worship has distinguished you.

Without performing Hajj, you fulfilled the obligation of Hajj;
you feared neither weather nor death.
With your blisters you tended the wounds of the family;
you travelled to Karbala on foot.
What great purpose your drops of sweat have served:
Allah created angels from them.
